 "note": "Plays by itself, once per visit, between Isla on the balcony and the flaming towel. The towel blends into the wrong turn (a double exposure): four pictures that join edge to edge (11b_Dominics_Wrong_Turn_Calm_Authority), which the camera pans across as one room in 3D; then a cut to the docklands (calm authority, violence behind), then it flicks back to Ethel at the towel. The visitor cannot drag; moving the mouse still steers the depth. The six house stand-ins and the offshore stand-in were taken out.",
