 "cutNote": "The way in from the towel: a dream cut (style: drift, ink, flare, double, fracture, pull, flicker, underwater; or remove style for the old way, through the depth under the dark). duration in ms.",
 "perspectiveNote": "A camera in the room: layers (each layer drawn as a camera at the middle of the view would see it at its distance, the near a little larger, so the pan carries the near across the screen faster than the far) and depth (the depth maps do the same per pixel). 0 turns either off. The visitor's tilt adds on top, never past its own reach.",
 "lookNote": "echo: an afterimage that never leaves while here, so every movement (the camera, the hand's tilt) trails: a mind a beat behind. blur, trail: how much movement smears. cold, vignette, deepVignette, grain: the shocked, drained look.",
